{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce6rGfaX6UwjhMBkq17Br","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Branch type derives deterministically to `feat` (helper is keyed on `changelog_category: Changed`, not on commit type) — I'll flag that divergence from your `chore` commit type in the summary rather than hand-override a deterministic helper.\n\n## FR draft — `DST-<tracker-id>` (milestone `M_DST_74`)\n\n**Title:** tooling-and-gate — record the canonical gate command and its tooling versions in the technical spec\n\n**Summary**\n> Anyone joining this repository has to reconstruct how a change is verified from two places, and neither of them is the technical specification.\n> The command that must pass before anything merges is written down only in the project contract file, while the versions of the runtime and the type checker that command depends on sit scattered across a design-decisions table and a dependencies table.\n> A reader who wants to know what green means, and on which tooling, has to stitch three fragments together and trust that none has drifted.\n> This change records both facts in the technical specification itself, as one named contract that can be checked at a glance.\n> It is documentation only — no source module, no test, and no build setting is touched.\n\n**Requirement** — Add a Tooling & Gate section to `specs/technical-spec.md` recording (a) the canonical gate command verbatim and (b) the tooling versions it runs on. No source file, test file, or build config changes.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria (2)**\n- `AC-<tracker-id>.1`: `specs/technical-spec.md` records the gate command verbatim as `bunx tsc --noEmit && bun test`, byte-identical to the Gating rule line in `CLAUDE.md`.\n- `AC-<tracker-id>.2`: `specs/technical-spec.md` records the tooling versions the gate runs on — Bun `1.3.14`, TypeScript `5.9.3` (what `bunx tsc` resolves from the `typescript` `^5` peer range), and `@types/bun` at `latest`.\n\nDraft gate: marker `PRESENT` → **default-applied**. Creating the tracker Task."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3207,"cache_read_input_tokens":107895,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3207},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52db325d-f99d-4924-9257-a07a3d9431f6","uuid":"8e19bbe8-2d6f-44a2-8b12-e07d14904152","timestamp":"2026-08-16T17:50:27.009Z","request_id":"req_011Ce6rGdu4kmV3tBZBNZAn3"}
